      "updated": 1780386156336,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Testing and Deployment List\n\n1. Gitops Deployments with Gitlab\n(testing with one microservice app)\n(can use dotnet banking app)\n\n2. Gitoops Deployments with Gitlab\n(test can deploy with yaml)\n(deploy wso2 APIM and Wso2 IS)\n\n3. GitOps deployments with Gitlab\n(test with apim and is integration to\nmicroservice app)\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "gXLIcImkbaprfyHNeCwdH",
      "originalText": "Testing and Deployment List\n\n1. Gitops Deployments with Gitlab\n(testing with one microservice app)\n(can use dotnet banking app)\n\n2. Gitoops Deployments with Gitlab\n(test can deploy with yaml)\n(deploy wso2 APIM and Wso2 IS)\n\n3. GitOps deployments with Gitlab\n(test with apim and is integration to microservice app)\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
